  },
  "description_short": "Kenvue Inc. is a consumer health company that provides a wide range of products across various categories, including skin and personal care, oral care, and over-the-counter pharmaceuticals. The company is committed to improving the health and well-being of consumers through innovative and science-backed solutions.",
